---

<section class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 bg-navy overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle background pattern -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, white 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <div class="animate-on-scroll">
      <span class="inline-block bg-orange/20 text-orange text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-6 uppercase tracking-wider">
        Our Philosophy
      </span>
      <blockquote class="mb-8">
        <p class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-tight italic">
          "Inclusion is our Winning Strategy."
        </p>
      </blockquote>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-white/70 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        At Jahn Robotics, we don't just build robots — we build teams. Based in Chicago Public Schools, we prove that a <strong class="text-white font-semibold">No-Cut policy</strong> isn't a barrier to excellence — it's the engine behind it. In three years, we've grown from a single kit to a state-qualifying program where every student, regardless of background or ability, has a seat at the table.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a href="/about/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-electric hover:text-white font-medium transition-colors">
          Learn more about our mission
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
